{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/Midgardr_board.gif?t=1748962301\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2060\u2726\u00a0<strong>Midgardr</strong> is a solo, turn-based card game where you take on the role of a medieval administrator sent to shape a distant frontier town. Manage resources, construct districts, and carefully select the members of your <strong>Curtes</strong>, all while facing moral dilemmas and unpredictable events that will shape the village\u2019s fate over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/Midgardr_rules_eng.png?t=1748962301\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/Midgardr_resources_eng.png?t=1748962301\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/Midgardr_compass_statistics.gif?t=1748962301\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2726 <strong>Buildings and Resources</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2060</strong>Gather wood, stone, and coin to expand your village. Manage your resources wisely: build houses to grow your population, markets and mills to store and produce food, political and military structures to govern and defend. Every urban choice has lasting consequences\u2026 and your people are watching. Will they remember you as a generous ruler, or a power-hungry tyrant?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/Midgardr_resources.gif?t=1748962301\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/Midgardr_buildings.gif?t=1748962301\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2726 <strong>Curtes and Politics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2060</strong>The <i>Curtes</i> is the heart of your domain. Each member brings their own views and influence <br>over village politics. It's up to you to maintain balance\u2026 but don\u2019t underestimate fate. Some may fall ill, or even lose their minds...shattering your careful plans in an instant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/Midgardr_cards.gif?t=1748962301\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/curtes.gif?t=1748962301\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2726 <strong>Events of Fate</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2060</strong>Your village will face strange and sudden events. A miraculous harvest: gift from the heavens or ancient curse? Knights in the woods: refugees or revenants? A strange egg: good omen or the spark of calamity? You cannot escape fate, but you can choose how to face it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/Midgardr_events.gif?t=1748962301\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/Midgardr_event_card.gif?t=1748962301\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2726 <strong>Quests and Encounters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2060</strong>Throughout your reign, six mysterious figures will cross your path. Some will ask for favors, others will plant seeds of doubt, a few may try to guide\u2026 or manipulate you. It\u2019s up to you to decide whom to trust and whom to reject. But every choice comes at a cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/Midgards_gif_characters.gif?t=1748962301\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/extras/Midgardr_camera.gif?t=1748962301\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3645410?t=1748962301","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/7f6222ef5ffda623c2502bcb829499888b7540a1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748962301","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/273478e3a9dfd759971c0090650afa64f63ecbe6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748962301","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645410/273478e3a9dfd759971c0090650afa64f63ecbe6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748962301","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description